## Frontend User Message Bubble Component - Edit and Delete Icons

**Location:** `/Users/cyyeh/Desktop/duckdb-data-agent/frontend/src/components/MessageBubble.tsx`

### Icon Elements (Lines 234-251)

The edit and delete icons are rendered as Unicode character buttons in the message header:

```tsx
{isUser && !isStreaming && !isEditing && !isConfirmingDelete && (
  <span className="message-bubble__actions">
    <button
      className="message-bubble__action-btn"
      onClick={handleEdit}
      title={t('editMessage')}
    >
      &#9998;
    </button>
    <button
      className="message-bubble__action-btn message-bubble__action-btn--delete"
      onClick={() => setIsConfirmingDelete(true)}
      title={t('deleteMessage')}
    >
      &#128465;
    </button>
  </span>
)}
```

**Icon Details:**
- **Edit Icon:** `&#9998;` (pencil/edit symbol)
- **Delete Icon:** `&#128465;` (trash can emoji)
- Both are rendered as text content within `<button>` elements
- No size props on the buttons themselves

### CSS Styling (Lines 333-362)

**Container styling (`message-bubble__actions`):**
```css
.message-bubble__actions {
  display: none;
  margin-left: auto;
  gap: 4px;
}

.message-bubble--user:hover .message-bubble__actions {
  display: inline-flex;
}
```

**Individual button styling (`message-bubble__action-btn`):**
```css
.message-bubble__action-btn {
  background: none;
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 2px 4px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--color-text-disabled);
  border-radius: 4px;
  line-height: 1;
}

.message-bubble__action-btn:hover {
  background: var(--color-border-light);
  color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
}

.message-bubble__action-btn--delete:hover {
  background: var(--color-error-bg-hover);
  color: var(--color-error);
}
```

### User Message Block Styling (Lines 7-10)

The overall user message bubble height is controlled by:
```css
.message-bubble--user {
  background: var(--color-bg-user-msg);
  margin-left: 32px;
}

.message-bubble {
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
```

### Header Layout (Lines 18-28)

The header that contains the icons uses flexbox:
```css
.message-bubble__header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-text-subtle);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}
```

### Key Behaviors

1. **Icons only appear on hover** - The `.message-bubble__actions` container has `display: none` by default and only shows on `.message-bubble--user:hover`
2. **Icons hidden during interactions** - They're not shown when the component is streaming (`isStreaming`), in edit mode (`isEditing`), or confirming delete (`isConfirmingDelete`)
3. **Icon spacing** - The action buttons have a `gap: 4px` between them
4. **Icon positioning** - `margin-left: auto` on the actions container pushes the icons to the right side of the header
5. **Icon height control** - The line-height is set to 1 and padding is 2px 4px, keeping the icons compact within the header

